  "rationale": "The official agenda (retained-agenda) titles the recording as 'Joint Meeting #2 of the Comprehensive Plan Advisory Committee (CPAC), Planning & Zoning Commission (P&Z), and City Council' and its call-to-order item names a proven participant for each body: Mayor Bruce Arfsten (City Council), Chair Denise Fansler (Planning & Zoning Commission), and Chair Susan Halpern (Comprehensive Plan Advisory Committee). The provider-player transcript independently confirms all three bodies were called to order with a quorum announced for each, and the native-source-chapters mirror the joint convening and agenda. Under the joints policy, every proven participant shares the same recording in its configured feed, so this assignment covers addison-tx-city-council, addison-tx-planning-and-zoning-commission, and addison-tx-comprehensive-plan-advisory-committee. Venue (Addison Conference Center), topics (Advance Addison 2050, catalyst redevelopment), and the citizen comment segment do not change the convened-body identity, and the Public Input feed is not supported because this is a formal joint meeting of convened bodies rather than a town hall or open house; the public_comment policy also bars routine comment from adding Public Info membership. Other feeds (zoning adjustment, bond, TIF, UDC, community partnership, public briefings) match no proven participant. Evidence is recording-specific and complete, so no gaps are cited."
